      "html": "<section class=\"ds-scenario\"><aside><h3>按键读取</h3><p>按 ID 读取一份完整档案，转换为业务对象。</p><p class=\"ds-comparison\"><strong>1.62×</strong>FengquDB ÷ 其他最高吞吐</p></aside><div class=\"ds-plot-area\"><div class=\"ds-plot-wrap\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"横向滚动查看五种数据库\"><svg class=\"ds-plot\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 324\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"按键读取，确认吞吐 · 次/秒，128 B 简介，8 线程\"><title>按键读取，确认吞吐 · 次/秒，128 B 简介，8 线程</title><line x1=\"78\" y1=\"264\" x2=\"780\" y2=\"264\" class=\"ds-axis\"/><text x=\"66\" y=\"268\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><line x1=\"78\" y1=\"187.666667\" x2=\"780\" y2=\"187.666667\" class=\"ds-grid\"/><text x=\"66\" y=\"191.666667\" text-anchor=\"end\">2,000,000</text><line x1=\"78\" y1=\"111.333333\" x2=\"780\" y2=\"111.333333\" class=\"ds-grid\"/><text x=\"66\" y=\"115.333333\" text-anchor=\"end\">4,000,000</text><line x1=\"78\" y1=\"35\" x2=\"780\" y2=\"35\" class=\"ds-grid\"/><text x=\"66\" y=\"39\" text-anchor=\"end\">6,000,000</text><rect x=\"115.2\" y=\"260.564515\" width=\"66\" height=\"3.435485\" fill=\"#799198\"><title>MySQL: 90,013，范围 86,176–92,029</title></rect><line x1=\"148.2\" y1=\"260.710957\" x2=\"148.2\" y2=\"260.487548\" class=\"ds-range\"/><line x1=\"143.2\" y1=\"260.710957\" x2=\"153.2\" y2=\"260.710957\" class=\"ds-range\"/><line x1=\"143.2\" y1=\"260.487548\" x2=\"153.2\" y2=\"260.487548\" class=\"ds-range\"/><text x=\"148.2\" y=\"250.487548\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ds-value\">90,013</text><text x=\"148.2\" y=\"292\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ds-engine-label\">MySQL</text><rect x=\"255.6\" y=\"259.431794\" width=\"66\" height=\"4.568206\" fill=\"#6e8594\"><title>Redis: 119,691，范围 84,362–160,139</title></rect><line x1=\"288.6\" y1=\"260.780165\" x2=\"288.6\" y2=\"257.888028\" class=\"ds-range\"/><line x1=\"283.6\" y1=\"260.780165\" x2=\"293.6\" y2=\"260.780165\" class=\"ds-range\"/><line x1=\"283.6\" y1=\"257.888028\" x2=\"293.6\" y2=\"257.888028\" class=\"ds-range\"/><text x=\"288.6\" y=\"247.888028\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ds-value\">119,691</text><text x=\"288.6\" y=\"292\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ds-engine-label\">Redis</text><rect x=\"396\" y=\"257.589946\" width=\"66\" height=\"6.410054\" fill=\"#788b7c\"><title>MySQL+Redis: 167,949，范围 114,948–221,291</title></rect><line x1=\"429\" y1=\"259.612818\" x2=\"429\" y2=\"255.55406\" class=\"ds-range\"/><line x1=\"424\" y1=\"259.612818\" x2=\"434\" y2=\"259.612818\" class=\"ds-range\"/><line x1=\"424\" y1=\"255.55406\" x2=\"434\" y2=\"255.55406\" class=\"ds-range\"/><text x=\"429\" y=\"245.55406\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ds-value\">167,949</text><text x=\"429\" y=\"292\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ds-engine-label\">MySQL+Redis</text><rect x=\"536.4\" y=\"172.42061\" width=\"66\" height=\"91.57939\" fill=\"#647e80\"><title>SQLite: 2,399,460，范围 1,862,570–3,199,270</title></rect><line x1=\"569.4\" y1=\"192.911912\" x2=\"569.4\" y2=\"141.894528\" class=\"ds-range\"/><line x1=\"564.4\" y1=\"192.911912\" x2=\"574.4\" y2=\"192.911912\" class=\"ds-range\"/><line x1=\"564.4\" y1=\"141.894528\" x2=\"574.4\" y2=\"141.894528\" class=\"ds-range\"/><text x=\"569.4\" y=\"131.894528\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ds-value\">2,399,460</text><text x=\"569.4\" y=\"292\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ds-engine-label\">SQLite</text><rect x=\"676.8\" y=\"115.32862\" width=\"66\" height=\"148.67138\" fill=\"#126247\"><title>FengquDB: 3,895,320，范围 2,803,230–4,966,800</title></rect><line x1=\"709.8\" y1=\"157.010055\" x2=\"709.8\" y2=\"74.4338\" class=\"ds-range\"/><line x1=\"704.8\" y1=\"157.010055\" x2=\"714.8\" y2=\"157.010055\" class=\"ds-range\"/><line x1=\"704.8\" y1=\"74.4338\" x2=\"714.8\" y2=\"74.4338\" class=\"ds-range\"/><text x=\"709.8\" y=\"64.4338\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ds-value\">3,895,320</text><text x=\"709.8\" y=\"292\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ds-fq-label\">FengquDB</text></svg></div></div></section>",
      "css": ".ds-scenario{display:grid;grid-template-columns:230px minmax(0,1fr);gap:40px;border-top:1px solid var(--line,#cbd4cf);padding:36px 0 32px;color:var(--ink,#152a2d);font:16px/1.7 system-ui,-apple-system,\"Segoe UI\",\"Microsoft YaHei\",sans-serif}.ds-scenario h3{font-size:21px;line-height:1.45;margin:4px 0 12px;letter-spacing:-.02em}.ds-scenario aside p{font-size:14px;color:var(--muted,#506264);max-width:72ch;margin:0 0 16px}.ds-scenario .ds-comparison{font-size:14px;color:var(--ink,#152a2d);margin-top:24px}.ds-comparison strong{display:block;color:var(--green,#126247);font-size:20px;line-height:1.5;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-plot-area{min-width:0}.ds-plot-wrap{overflow-x:auto;scrollbar-color:#9baa9f var(--paper,#f7f8f4);scrollbar-width:thin}.ds-plot-wrap:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--focus,#175d8d);outline-offset:4px}.ds-plot{display:block;width:100%;min-width:610px;height:auto;overflow:visible}.ds-plot text{font-family:inherit;fill:var(--muted,#506264);font-size:12px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-plot text.ds-value{fill:var(--ink,#152a2d);font-size:12px;font-weight:650}.ds-plot text.ds-fq-label{fill:var(--green,#126247);font-weight:750}.ds-plot .ds-grid{stroke:#e0e5e0;stroke-width:1}.ds-plot .ds-axis{stroke:#8d9c94;stroke-width:1}.ds-plot .ds-range{stroke:#243f38;stroke-width:1.4}@media(max-width:900px){.ds-scenario{grid-template-columns:185px minmax(0,1fr);gap:24px}.ds-plot-wrap{margin-right:-8px}}@media(max-width:620px){.ds-scenario{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:8px;padding:26px 0}.ds-scenario h3{font-size:20px}.ds-scenario aside p{max-width:38ch}.ds-scenario .ds-comparison{margin-top:12px}.ds-comparison strong{display:inline;font-size:17px;margin-right:10px}.ds-plot-wrap{margin-right:-22px}.ds-plot text.ds-value,.ds-plot text.ds-engine-label,.ds-plot text.ds-fq-label{font-size:16px}}"
