      "description": "同一按键读取场景的 15 个真实样本；原生展开入口与可聚焦的宽表滚动区域。",
      "html": "<details class=\"ds-data\"><summary>查看逐轮数据 · 15 个样本</summary><div class=\"ds-table-wrap\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"逐轮测量表，可横向滚动\"><table><caption>按键读取 · 吞吐单位 次/秒，延迟单位 μs</caption><thead><tr><th>数据库 / 轮次</th><th>确认吞吐</th><th>含同步吞吐</th><th>P50</th><th>P95</th><th>P99</th><th>调用次数</th><th>同步尾部 ms</th><th>容器 MiB</th><th>CPU ms</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>MySQL / 1</th><td>90,013</td><td>89,940</td><td>80.54</td><td>169</td><td>235</td><td>135,488</td><td>1.22</td><td>486</td><td>3,005</td></tr><tr><th>MySQL / 2</th><td>86,176</td><td>86,101</td><td>77.91</td><td>204</td><td>342</td><td>129,664</td><td>1.31</td><td>1,982</td><td>3,009</td></tr><tr><th>MySQL / 3</th><td>92,029</td><td>91,953</td><td>76.12</td><td>192</td><td>296</td><td>138,496</td><td>1.25</td><td>449</td><td>3,009</td></tr><tr><th>Redis / 1</th><td>160,139</td><td>159,877</td><td>32.68</td><td>127</td><td>211</td><td>240,704</td><td>2.46</td><td>26</td><td>2,595</td></tr><tr><th>Redis / 2</th><td>84,362</td><td>84,236</td><td>73.05</td><td>225</td><td>393</td><td>126,976</td><td>2.25</td><td>23.73</td><td>2,395</td></tr><tr><th>Redis / 3</th><td>119,691</td><td>119,512</td><td>47.18</td><td>174</td><td>325</td><td>180,032</td><td>2.25</td><td>24.28</td><td>2,606</td></tr><tr><th>MySQL+Redis / 1</th><td>221,291</td><td>221,111</td><td>25.57</td><td>93.17</td><td>153</td><td>332,928</td><td>1.22</td><td>354</td><td>2,778</td></tr><tr><th>MySQL+Redis / 2</th><td>167,949</td><td>167,806</td><td>30.45</td><td>138</td><td>262</td><td>252,800</td><td>1.28</td><td>1,588</td><td>2,747</td></tr><tr><th>MySQL+Redis / 3</th><td>114,948</td><td>114,849</td><td>41.29</td><td>217</td><td>498</td><td>172,800</td><td>1.3</td><td>354</td><td>2,653</td></tr><tr><th>SQLite / 1</th><td>3,199,270</td><td>3,198,720</td><td>0.61</td><td>0.74</td><td>0.92</td><td>4,801,280</td><td>0.26</td><td>19.97</td><td>2,981</td></tr><tr><th>SQLite / 2</th><td>2,399,460</td><td>2,398,910</td><td>0.68</td><td>1.19</td><